            "notes": "The default pick is ironclad and some combination of green survival-weapon items. You gain significant survivability, as ironclad stacks to a 100. You can be a flank nuisance, but still mostly harmless.\n\nif you are rich, you may pick  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) + [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) . This ensures that enemy tank won't be happy, but requires other support to lean into healing. \n\nIf you are not rich, you can still pick [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429), but this comes with expectation that the rest of your team to cooperate, as you are both too squishy to draw attention from them and won't heal when focusing on tank.\n\nAdditional option is to pick  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb)  and have similar style of play as r1.\nIt's unlikely you will be rich enough to get it with  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) .",
