            "notes": "This one is a blaster-focused item layout. Includes  [Gravitational Push](item_2df314f2-c983-4984-bb08-070f93add5e1) for some bulling potential. \n\nCan pick either [Black Hole](item_d9edbd0b-d1e2-4103-b8d4-6e1dc8124894) and  \n[Rally Ring](item_0547012b-4817-437e-aad3-aa37db93383e) to increase ring and overhealth uptime. The extra slow is also very bad for genji/lucio/queen/dva to work with.\nAlternatively, [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) can be used for a reliable 11-12dps. \nAlternatively, [Medimaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6) can provide extra 50% crit for weapon damage (25% against tanks) that does not apply to dps from items. Tanks can also pick extra 20% crit reduction, leaving only 5%. Pick this power if you have good aim against squishy targets or would like an option for higher healing output on your tank.\n\nItem alternaatives:\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for survival and 290 dps (+crit) against 1000 hp target, 260 against 450hp target.\n [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) for unlimited ammo. This one is not too important, since you need to have downtime to recover hp/cooldowns with this item layout.\n [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) for max dps. It will max out at 330 dps (+crit) against 1000 hp target, 300 against 450hp target.\n [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) for those juno vs juno matches.\nOr just keep  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), if a bit short on money, for max survival.",
